For ease of use, timing models will be made available in both Tempo212(Hobbs and Edwards, 2012) and PINT formats. In addition, the correlation matrices for fit parameters of all pulsars are provided in the following formats:

Footnote 12: [https://bitbucket.org/psrsoft/tempo2](https://bitbucket.org/psrsoft/tempo2)

* Human-readable list of pairwise correlations (*.txt),

